@@ -6715,3 +6715,6 @@ RVR_57=Rules go live when you apply and are reverted automatically unless you ke
 RVR_58=IPv6 is covered: a destination list matches its IPv6 addresses and a MAC rule follows the device on both families. If the chosen tunnel carries no IPv6, the selected IPv6 traffic is blocked rather than leaked around it.
